  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Much of your lineage is comprised of smilodon, all the way to the first who have survived against all odds to get this far. As a result, you are physically built like an apex predator. You increase the damage die size of any unarmed attack you gain from your ancestry or heritage that deals less than 1d8 damage by one step, and increase your fist’s damage die to 1d6. You also gain your choice of the Feline Arms ancestry feat, Titan Wrestler, Underwater Marauder or Terrain Stalker skill feats, even if you don’t meet their prerequisites.</span></p>"
